# D-096 chatbox tabs. Script 178 draws the seven official tab graphics (enum 683) and sizes them 56x22 (58x24 on the
# 9336 skin). Ten tabs now share the bar, so the size becomes 41x22 (43x24), matching chatbox_tabs.toml. After the loop
# the custom tabs (162:570/573/576) are drawn from tp_chat_state (162:578): 3053 when selected, else 3051, the official
# normal/selected sprites. While a custom tab is selected CHAT_VIEW is 0, so the All graphic (162:5) is redrawn
# unselected (3052 when hovered, varc 42 = 0).
@@ tab size, large skin
LABEL80:
-   iconst                 58
-   iconst                 24
+   iconst                 43
+   iconst                 24
   iconst                 0
   iconst                 0
   iload                  3
   if_setsize
   jump                   LABEL93
LABEL87:
-   iconst                 56
+   iconst                 41
   iconst                 22
   iconst                 0
   iconst                 0
   iload                  3
   if_setsize
